        "id": "malfurion",
        "name": "Malfurion"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Artanis pairs extremely well with Healers who can provide sustained healing (such as Malfurion) to gradually replenish his Health while his own Shields guarantee him protection against burst damage, with Heroes who can crowd control enemy Heroes to either keep them at melee distance (for example Arthas with his Root or even just his Slow) or to stop them in place after a successful Blade Dash plus Phase Prism combo (like Kael'thas with Gravity Lapse), and Heroes who can mitigate his lack of mobility (such as Zarya with Speed Barrier at Level 4)."
  },
