      "name": "Blade Dash Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "Artanis's Blade Dash Build is designed to heavily increase your survivability by empowering Shield Overload as much as possible, indirectly helping you to deal more damage over the course of a team fight.\n\nThe combination of Shield Battery at Level 4, Templar's Zeal at Level 13, and Force of Will at Level 16 makes Artanis hard to take down even when countered by Blinds.\n\nLevel 13 can be either Phase Bulwark against burst damage or Templar's Zeal against sustain damage.",
